pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 12, 120, 20]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 12, 120, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      CH07
- elementId: bg-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 40, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
- elementId: bg-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 80, 1160, 230]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p>Confidential I/O 不只需要 DMA 隔离，也需要可信 interrupt/MSI delivery。runtime CFI 则是独立的控制流防护 substrate。</p>
- elementId: sep-line
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 330, 1160, 1]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $border
- elementId: sol-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 350, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
- elementId: sol-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 390, 1160, 260]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p>AIA 规范化 interrupt controller 与 MSI/virtual interrupt，为 confidential I/O 提供 trusted interrupt-delivery substrate。</p>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    text: |
      来源：RISC-V Advanced Interrupt Architecture｜证据等级：E0 / Spec-standard SOTA
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
